{"progress":{"data":{"delta":"Here's how to install Debian and open the desktop.\n\n1. Open Termux and install the tools:\n\n```bash\npkg update -y && pkg install wget proot -y\nandronix install debian\n```\n\n2. Start the VNC server inside Debian:\n\n```bash\nvncserver -localhost no :1\n```\n\n3. Connect your VNC viewer to `localhost:5901`.\n\nMore in [Install Debian](https://docs.andronix.app/use/install-debian) and [Set up VNC](https://docs.andronix.app/use/vnc).","kind":"text","partId":"run_3.0"},"scope":{"runId":"run_3","turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"content.delta"}}
